*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0026.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY FEE0026C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    05 EXTRA-TXN-FEE      PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CHARGE-EXCESS
    PERFORM BUSINESS-SURCHARGE
    DISPLAY "EXTRA-TXN-FEE=" EXTRA-TXN-FEE
    STOP RUN.
CHARGE-EXCESS.
    IF TXN-COUNT-MTH > 10
        COMPUTE EXTRA-TXN-FEE = (TXN-COUNT-MTH - 10) * 0.50
    END-IF.
BUSINESS-SURCHARGE.
    *> BUSINESS HIGH-VOLUME SURCHARGE
    IF ACCOUNT-TYPE = 'B' AND TXN-COUNT-MTH > 30
        ADD 10 TO EXTRA-TXN-FEE
    END-IF.
